    "text": "12onyourside.com\nwebsite\nChesterfield\nChesterfield Police searching for missing man suffering from dementia\nBy Rory Johnson,\n2 hours agoCHESTERFIELD, Va. (WWBT) - Chesterfield Police are searching for a missing man who was last seen leaving his home in the 200 block of Brickland Road. It happened on Aug, 13, around 5 p.m. Officials said he was last seen driving a dark blue 2016 BMW with a Virginia tag reading: JVK-9270.",
